            <description><![CDATA[<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,system-ui;margin:0;padding:0;color:#111}h2{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 4px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin-bottom:6px}code{font:11px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo;background:rgba(127,127,127,.15);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#eee}}</style><h2>Version 1.0.1</h2><ul><li>Turn each goal, and the This week card, on or off per sport. Switching one off keeps its number for later</li><li>Clearer goal editing: the number sits in an input box, and &quot;Suggest a goal&quot; is a proper button with a tidier set of suggestions</li><li>A bigger Settings window with larger controls and its pages listed down the left: General, Menu bar, Goals, Sports, Fitness, Notifications, Account, Updates and a new About page</li><li>Lime progress bars, chart lines and ahead-of-pace figures in light mode too, in deeper shades so they stay readable</li></ul>]]></description>
